This PR brings support for autoscrolling, same as in RevealHighlight plugins. 

When using steps `code-line-numbers= "|4,8-11|17|22-24"`, it will create fragmented highlights. When the code chunk is long, revealjs will add a scroll. So going to next step is not so useful unless we gat autoscroll. This PR does that. 

The code comes from revealHighlight plugins, but adapted to our usage, so a few tweaks. 
There is also a CSS adjustment required. 

Support covers also `print-pdf` feature - all fragment will be printed by default and it will scroll in the pre to print the correct highlighted part.

